  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPECIAL ACCOUNT FOR VILLA OCAMPO DONATIONS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 1973 Victoria Ocampo donated Villa Ocampo to UNESCO, this donation was motivated by the many coincidences 
between Victoria Ocampo&apos;s values and those of the Organization: the role of Culture as a factor of development and social inclusion; promotion of cultural diversity and women&apos;s rights; tolerance and opening up to other people&apos;s ideas and beliefs.

Currently, the Observatory UNESCO Villa Ocampo has set itself the task of attracting, coordinating and disseminating the work of knowledge-producing centers with a view on cultural diversity, creativity and heritage with an intersectorial approach.</narrative>
  </description>
